From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FerrionOS contributors <contributors@ferrion.invalid>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:28:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] backend: Support multiple outputs and per-output pacing in ferrion-wm

Replace single-output state in src/backend/ferrion.rs with per-connector
HeadState entries keyed from ferrion-wm-backend::OutputInfo, route
FlipComplete by flip.crtc (ignoring stale completions with one warning),
append output=<name> to FERRION_FRAME and outputs=<n> to FERRION_READY,
make defer_redraw per-output so a FlipPending head does not starve other
ready outputs in Niri::redraw_queued_outputs, and diff hotplug changes
while keeping unchanged heads live.
